#: ../../source/reference/learn/generated/maxframe.learn.tree.DecisionTreeRegressor.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.learn.tree.DecisionTreeRegressor"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.tree._classes.DecisionTreeRegressor:1 of
msgid "A distributed decision tree regressor."
msgstr "分布式决策树回归器。"

#: maxframe.learn.tree._classes.DecisionTreeRegressor:3 of
msgid ""
"This estimator implements a distributed version of the decision tree "
"regressor using approximate split finding with feature binning, following"
" the approach described in [1]_. The algorithm is designed for large-"
"scale datasets that do not fit in a single machine's memory and runs on "
"MaxCompute's distributed execution engine."
msgstr ""
"该估计器使用特征分箱的近似分裂查找方法实现决策树回归器的分布式版本，遵循 "
"[1]_ 中描述的方法。该算法专为无法装入单机内存的大规模数据集设计，运行在 "
"MaxCompute 的分布式执行引擎上。"

#: maxframe.learn.tree._classes.DecisionTreeRegressor:9 of
msgid ""
"Unlike scikit-learn's DecisionTreeRegressor which uses an exact greedy "
"algorithm to find optimal split points, this implementation discretizes "
"continuous features into bins and finds approximate splits. This trades a"
" small amount of split quality for the ability to efficiently aggregate "
"statistics across distributed partitions."
msgstr ""
"与 scikit-learn 的 DecisionTreeRegressor 使用精确贪心算法寻找最优分裂点"
"不同，本实现将连续特征离散化为分箱并寻找近似分裂。这以少量分裂质量为代价"
"，换取了跨分布式分区高效聚合统计信息的能力。"

#: ../../source/reference/learn/generated/maxframe.learn.tree.DecisionTreeRegressor.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.tree._classes.DecisionTreeRegressor:15 of
msgid ""
"The function to measure the quality of a split. Supported criteria are "
"\"squared_error\" for the mean squared error, which is equal to variance "
"reduction as feature selection criterion and minimizes L2 loss using the "
"mean of each terminal node.  .. note::     \"absolute_error\", "
"\"friedman_mse\", and \"poisson\" criteria are     not yet supported in "
"the distributed implementation."
msgstr ""
"用于衡量分裂质量的函数。支持的判据为 \"squared_error\"（均方误差），它"
"等同于方差减少作为特征选择判据，并使用每个终端节点的均值最小化 L2 损失。 "
" .. note::     \"absolute_error\"、\"friedman_mse\" 和 \"poisson\" 判据在"
"分布式实现中尚未支持。"

#: maxframe.learn.tree._classes.DecisionTreeRegressor:15 of
msgid ""
"The function to measure the quality of a split. Supported criteria are "
"\"squared_error\" for the mean squared error, which is equal to variance "
"reduction as feature selection criterion and minimizes L2 loss using the "
"mean of each terminal node."
msgstr ""
"用于衡量分裂质量的函数。支持的判据为 \"squared_error\"（均方误差），它"
"等同于方差减少作为特征选择判据，并使用每个终端节点的均值最小化 L2 损失。"

#: maxframe.learn.tree._classes.DecisionTreeRegressor:21 of
msgid ""
"\"absolute_error\", \"friedman_mse\", and \"poisson\" criteria are not "
"yet supported in the distributed implementation."
msgstr ""
"\"absolute_error\"、\"friedman_mse\" 和 \"poisson\" 判据在分布式实现中"
"尚未支持。"

#: maxframe.learn.tree._classes.DecisionTreeRegressor:24 of
msgid ""
"The maximum depth of the tree. If None, then nodes are expanded until all"
" leaves contain less than min_samples_split samples. Note that very deep "
"trees may require many distributed communication rounds."
msgstr ""
"树的最大深度。如果为 None，则节点会一直展开，直到所有叶节点包含的样本数"
"少于 min_samples_split。注意，非常深的树可能需要多次分布式通信轮次。"

#: maxframe.learn.tree._classes.DecisionTreeRegressor:29 of
msgid ""
"The maximum number of bins used to discretize continuous features. Higher"
" values improve split approximation quality at the cost of increased "
"memory usage and communication overhead. This parameter has no equivalent"
" in scikit-learn and is specific to the distributed binning algorithm.  "
"Memory usage per node group is approximately ``n_features * max_bins * 3 "
"* 8`` bytes (3 doubles per bin for regression: count, sum, squared sum). "
"When the memory budget (controlled by ``max_memory_in_mb``) is exceeded, "
"fewer nodes are processed per iteration, increasing the number of data "
"passes."
msgstr ""
"用于将连续特征离散化的最大分箱数。值越大，分裂近似质量越好，但内存占用和"
"通信开销也越大。此参数在 scikit-learn 中没有对应项，是分布式分箱算法特有"
"的。  每个节点组的内存使用量约为 ``n_features * max_bins * 3 * 8`` 字节（"
"回归中每个分箱 3 个 double：计数、和、平方和）。当超出内存预算（由 ``max_"
"memory_in_mb`` 控制）时，每次迭代处理的节点数会减少，从而增加数据遍历次数"
"。"

#: maxframe.learn.tree._classes.DecisionTreeRegressor:29 of
msgid ""
"The maximum number of bins used to discretize continuous features. Higher"
" values improve split approximation quality at the cost of increased "
"memory usage and communication overhead. This parameter has no equivalent"
" in scikit-learn and is specific to the distributed binning algorithm."
msgstr ""
"用于将连续特征离散化的最大分箱数。值越大，分裂近似质量越好，但内存占用和"
"通信开销也越大。此参数在 scikit-learn 中没有对应项，是分布式分箱算法特有"
"的。"

#: maxframe.learn.tree._classes.DecisionTreeRegressor:35 of
msgid ""
"Memory usage per node group is approximately ``n_features * max_bins * 3 "
"* 8`` bytes (3 doubles per bin for regression: count, sum, squared sum). "
"When the memory budget (controlled by ``max_memory_in_mb``) is exceeded, "
"fewer nodes are processed per iteration, increasing the number of data "
"passes."
msgstr ""
"每个节点组的内存使用量约为 ``n_features * max_bins * 3 * 8`` 字节（回归中"
"每个分箱 3 个 double：计数、和、平方和）。当超出内存预算（由 ``max_memory"
"_in_mb`` 控制）时，每次迭代处理的节点数会减少，从而增加数据遍历次数。"

#: maxframe.learn.tree._classes.DecisionTreeRegressor:41 of
msgid ""
"The minimum number of samples required to split an internal node:  - If "
"int, then consider `min_samples_split` as the minimum number. - If float,"
" then `min_samples_split` is a fraction and   `ceil(min_samples_split * "
"n_samples)` are the minimum   number of samples for each split."
msgstr ""
"分裂内部节点所需的最小样本数：  - 如果为 int，则将 `min_samples_split` "
"视为最小数量。  - 如果为 float，则 `min_samples_split` 为比例，且 `ceil("
"min_samples_split * n_samples)` 为每次分裂的最小样本数。"

#: maxframe.learn.tree._classes.DecisionTreeRegressor:41 of
msgid "The minimum number of samples required to split an internal node:"
msgstr "分裂内部节点所需的最小样本数："

#: maxframe.learn.tree._classes.DecisionTreeRegressor:43 of
msgid "If int, then consider `min_samples_split` as the minimum number."
msgstr "如果为 int，则将 `min_samples_split` 视为最小数量。"

#: maxframe.learn.tree._classes.DecisionTreeRegressor:44 of
msgid ""
"If float, then `min_samples_split` is a fraction and "
"`ceil(min_samples_split * n_samples)` are the minimum number of samples "
"for each split."
msgstr ""
"如果为 float，则 `min_samples_split` 为比例，且 `ceil(min_samples_split *"
" n_samples)` 为每次分裂的最小样本数。"

#: maxframe.learn.tree._classes.DecisionTreeRegressor:48 of
msgid ""
"The minimum number of samples required to be at a leaf node. A split "
"point at any depth will only be considered if it leaves at least "
"``min_samples_leaf`` training samples in each of the left and right "
"branches.  - If int, then consider `min_samples_leaf` as the minimum "
"number. - If float, then `min_samples_leaf` is a fraction and   "
"`ceil(min_samples_leaf * n_samples)` are the minimum   number of samples "
"for each node."
msgstr ""
"叶节点所需的最小样本数。在任何深度，只有当分裂在左右分支中各留下至少 ``"
"min_samples_leaf`` 个训练样本时，该分裂点才会被考虑。  - 如果为 int，则将"
" `min_samples_leaf` 视为最小数量。  - 如果为 float，则 `min_samples_leaf`"
" 为比例，且 `ceil(min_samples_leaf * n_samples)` 为每个节点的最小样本数。"

#: maxframe.learn.tree._classes.DecisionTreeRegressor:48 of
msgid ""
"The minimum number of samples required to be at a leaf node. A split "
"point at any depth will only be considered if it leaves at least "
"``min_samples_leaf`` training samples in each of the left and right "
"branches."
msgstr ""
"叶节点所需的最小样本数。在任何深度，只有当分裂在左右分支中各留下至少 ``"
"min_samples_leaf`` 个训练样本时，该分裂点才会被考虑。"

#: maxframe.learn.tree._classes.DecisionTreeRegressor:53 of
msgid "If int, then consider `min_samples_leaf` as the minimum number."
msgstr "如果为 int，则将 `min_samples_leaf` 视为最小数量。"

#: maxframe.learn.tree._classes.DecisionTreeRegressor:54 of
msgid ""
"If float, then `min_samples_leaf` is a fraction and "
"`ceil(min_samples_leaf * n_samples)` are the minimum number of samples "
"for each node."
msgstr ""
"如果为 float，则 `min_samples_leaf` 为比例，且 `ceil(min_samples_leaf * n"
"_samples)` 为每个节点的最小样本数。"

#: maxframe.learn.tree._classes.DecisionTreeRegressor:58 of
msgid ""
"The minimum weighted fraction of the sum total of weights (of all the "
"input samples) required to be at a leaf node. Samples have equal weight "
"when sample_weight is not provided."
msgstr ""
"所有输入样本权重总和中，叶节点所需的最小加权比例。当未提供 sample_weight "
"时，样本权重相等。"

#: maxframe.learn.tree._classes.DecisionTreeRegressor:62 of
msgid ""
"The number of features to consider when looking for the best split:  - If"
" int, then consider `max_features` features at each split. - If float, "
"then `max_features` is a fraction and   `max(1, int(max_features * "
"n_features))` features are considered. - If \"sqrt\", then "
"`max_features=sqrt(n_features)`. - If \"log2\", then "
"`max_features=log2(n_features)`. - If None, then "
"`max_features=n_features`."
msgstr ""
"寻找最佳分裂时考虑的特征数：  - 如果为 int，则每次分裂考虑 `max_features`"
" 个特征。  - 如果为 float，则 `max_features` 为比例，且考虑 `max(1, int("
"max_features * n_features))` 个特征。  - 如果为 \"sqrt\"，则 `max_"
"features=sqrt(n_features)`。  - 如果为 \"log2\"，则 `max_features=log2(n_"
"features)`。  - 如果为 None，则 `max_features=n_features`。"

#: maxframe.learn.tree._classes.DecisionTreeRegressor:62 of
msgid "The number of features to consider when looking for the best split:"
msgstr "寻找最佳分裂时考虑的特征数："

#: maxframe.learn.tree._classes.DecisionTreeRegressor:64 of
msgid "If int, then consider `max_features` features at each split."
msgstr "如果为 int，则每次分裂考虑 `max_features` 个特征。"

#: maxframe.learn.tree._classes.DecisionTreeRegressor:65 of
msgid ""
"If float, then `max_features` is a fraction and `max(1, int(max_features "
"* n_features))` features are considered."
msgstr ""
"如果为 float，则 `max_features` 为比例，且考虑 `max(1, int(max_features *"
" n_features))` 个特征。"

#: maxframe.learn.tree._classes.DecisionTreeRegressor:67 of
msgid "If \"sqrt\", then `max_features=sqrt(n_features)`."
msgstr "如果为 \"sqrt\"，则 `max_features=sqrt(n_features)`。"

#: maxframe.learn.tree._classes.DecisionTreeRegressor:68 of
msgid "If \"log2\", then `max_features=log2(n_features)`."
msgstr "如果为 \"log2\"，则 `max_features=log2(n_features)`。"

#: maxframe.learn.tree._classes.DecisionTreeRegressor:69 of
msgid "If None, then `max_features=n_features`."
msgstr "如果为 None，则 `max_features=n_features`。"

#: maxframe.learn.tree._classes.DecisionTreeRegressor:71 of
msgid ""
"Controls the randomness of the estimator. To obtain a deterministic "
"behaviour during fitting, ``random_state`` has to be fixed to an integer."
msgstr ""
"控制估计器的随机性。要在拟合过程中获得确定性行为，需将 ``random_state`` "
"固定为整数。"

#: maxframe.learn.tree._classes.DecisionTreeRegressor:75 of
msgid ""
"A node will be split if this split induces a decrease of the impurity "
"greater than or equal to this value."
msgstr "如果分裂导致的不纯度减少大于或等于此值，则节点将被分裂。"

#: maxframe.learn.tree._classes.DecisionTreeRegressor:78 of
msgid ""
"The maximum memory in MB to use for aggregating statistics for a group of"
