"\"friedman_mse\", and \"poisson\" criteria are not yet available in the "
"distributed implementation."
msgstr ""
"仅支持 \"squared_error\" 判据。\"absolute_error\"、\"friedman_mse\" 和 \""
"poisson\" 判据在分布式实现中尚不可用。"

#: maxframe.learn.tree._classes.DecisionTreeRegressor:147 of
